{"unit_id":"tag:0GIZ:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为 Noether 环（Noetherian ring）。设 <MATH_0002> 为素数（prime number），且 <MATH_0003>。设 <MATH_0004> 为有限（finite）<MATH_0005>-群（group）。设 <MATH_0006> 为有限（finite）<MATH_0007>-模（module），被 <MATH_0008> 零化（annihilated）。则存在有限滤过（finite filtration）<MATH_0009>，由 <MATH_0010>-子模（submodules）构成，使得 <MATH_0011> 在 <MATH_0012> 上平凡作用（acts trivially），对所有 <MATH_0013> 成立。\n","allowed_english":["Noether"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether 环"},{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化"},{"source_term":"finite filtration","target_term":"有限滤过"},{"source_term":"submodules","target_term":"子模"},{"source_term":"acts trivially","target_term":"平凡作用"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"Noetherian ring","target_term":"Noether 环","context":"环的类型，待决定。"},{"source_term":"prime number","target_term":"素数","context":"数学用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"群或模的有限性，待决定。"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"annihilated","target_term":"零化","context":"模的零化，待决定。"},{"source_term":"finite filtration","target_term":"有限滤过","context":"模的滤过，待决定。"},{"source_term":"submodules","target_term":"子模","context":"代数用语，待决定。"},{"source_term":"acts trivially","target_term":"平凡作用","context":"群的作用，待决定。"}],"notes":[]}
